window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>In a world where Elves reign supreme, humanity teeters on the brink of collapse, ravaged by a sinister drug that sows chaos and despair.</b><br> <b><br> </b>Rosanhi, a spirited human girl, is drawn into an ancient prophecy through a fated ceremony, unraveling hidden truths about her lineage and a love foretold by destiny. As she navigates a realm brimming with peril and enchantment, her fiery romance with an enigmatic elf becomes a beacon of hope against an encroaching darkness.<br> <br> Embers to Flames is a tale where not all princesses need a prince, but they sure are nice to have around. Rosanhi’s journey is one of fierce independence, the bonds of family, the discovery of true love, and the unwavering belief in oneself.<br> <br> Rosanhi must prepare to stand against the darkness that stirs beneath the surface of her world. She will soon face a war of power and a war of the heart.</p>"; 
